# Smash the Orcish Scouts (San d'Oria 1-1, mission.sandoria.smash_the_orcish_scouts), Endracion in Southern San d'Oria.
# A level 10 Warrior of San d'Oria holding an Orcish Axe and no mission (Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out). Section 1
# (no current mission, a San d'Orian, not completed): Endracion plays 1000; its finish with option 1 does nothing;
# again, with option 0: begun, YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION. Section 3 (1-1 current): Endracion plays ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET;
# the Axe traded: 1020 (not completed before), whose finish completes the mission (150 rank points) and takes the axe.
# Section 2 (no current mission, completed): Endracion's script plays 1009; its finish with option 0 begins the mission
# again (Southern San d'Oria's own 1009 registration). The Axe traded again: 1002 (completed before), whose finish
# completes it once more.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Endracion/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Endracion/onTrade SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1000 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1009 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1020 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1002
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-108.5,1,-34 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
item OrcishAxe
login
trigger Endracion                       # section 1: 1000
finish option=1                         # not 0: nothing
trigger Endracion                       # 1000 again
finish option=0                         # 0: begun, YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION
trigger Endracion                       # section 3: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET
walk -109.5,1,-34
trade Endracion OrcishAxe x1            # 1020: not completed before
finish                                  # completed (150 rank points); the axe taken
trigger Endracion                       # section 2 (completed): his script's 1009
finish option=0                         # 0: begun again, YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION
item OrcishAxe
trade Endracion OrcishAxe x1            # 1002: completed before
finish                                  # completed again
